# .env.sample is documentation, not configuration: the code does not read it.
# Secrets belong in the process environment or a secret manager. Put only
# names and purposes here so a new contributor knows what may be configured.
# The keyless default must work without any variable listed here.
#
# Entry format: NAME=   # purpose; what works without it
#
# Example (uncomment and adapt for the tool):
# EXAMPLE_API_KEY=   # optional paid source; the keyless path works without it
